# Everything in the sandbox is consumed by Linux inside the container. A
# Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise hand the image a
# CRLF `entrypoint.sh` (which fails to exec at all, with a misleading "no such
# file or directory") and a CRLF config template (which the TOML parser
# rejects with "carriage return must be followed by newline" — the app then
# falls back to defaults and reports "no provider configured").
sandbox/** text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
